<title>USA: Biomerica thyroid test wins FDA clearance.</title>
<headline>Biomerica thyroid test wins FDA clearance.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT BEACH, Calif. 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Biomerica Inc said Monday it received U.S. Food and Drug Administration clearance to market a test for detecting and monitoring certain thyroid diseases.</p>
<p>The non-radioactive enzyme immunoassay test detects thyroid stimulating hormone in blood.</p>
<p>Biomerica's test can identify both hypothyroidism and hyperthyroidism. It can also be used to follow up on thyroid substitution or suppression therapy.</p>
</text>
